rrors/README.md\n@@ -61,6 +61,8 @@ Run the non-mutating check from the repository root:\n node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs --check\n ```\n \n+The check also prints how many tracked commands each runtime shows. It fails when a command folder other than `create/` holds a `skill.md`, because Claude Code would then hide that folder's other commands.\n+\n ---\n \n ## 6. RELATED\n--- status ---\n M .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff -- .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md; echo \\\"--- status ---\\\"; git -c core.fsmonitor=false status --short -- .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794540100542,"end":1794540101839}}}}
